# CVE-2025-47273: path-traversal in setuptools' deprecated PackageIndex (easy_install-style
# index downloads), which the backend image never calls. The finding comes from pip's own
# bundled SBOM metadata (vendor.txt / bom.cdx.json inside the pip wheel itself, which
# references setuptools 70.3.0 as a historical build-provenance record) — not an installed,
# importable copy. pip and setuptools are both upgraded to current releases in Dockerfile;
# there is no vulnerable code actually present to fix.
CVE-2025-47273
